I step out of the flat.
I am walking to the bus stop.
Many people are standing at the bus stop.
The bus to Infopark arrives.
I get on the bus.
The conductor comes near me.
"Ticket to where?" he asks.
"To Infopark," I say.
I give him twenty rupees.
He gives me a ticket.
I put that ticket in my bag.
The bus is moving fast through the city.
Many vehicles are moving along the road.
